5,1,1,talk,George,,I worry we are just moving the sore point. Let us look at what sours groups like ours.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I need to see where the arranging hours actually go before we commit to another year.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I care about the state of the car when I pick it up on a plain morning.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I want to know what an even split actually accounts for, not just the idea of it.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I am curious about the real figures. I want to see who has been driving.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,George,,"@Toshio, your hours concern is valid. But we must also check the social friction.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@George, agreed. I will look at the diary hours and the mechanic's remarks.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I will check the state of the car at handover and the weekly trips.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I will look at the fuel receipts and the tax papers to see the true cost.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,I will look at the fuel receipts and the diary hours to understand the usage.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,George,,I will investigate the other households and the spell of checking figures.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,That sounds reasonable. Let us see what the data says before we argue.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I hope the handover state shows if we are being careless or just unlucky.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,The fuel receipts might show who is really using it. I am a bit absent-minded about this.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,I hope the numbers are clear. I do not like guessing with money.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,George,,Let us proceed with these investigations. I want to avoid repeating past mistakes.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will be brief. I just want the facts on the time cost.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will keep my observations private until I have the full picture.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I will try to be precise with the financial documents.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minato,,Okay. I will look at the receipts and the diary. Thank you all.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
