33,2,,status,Misaki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,George,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,George,,I found that asking favours sours relationships. Checking figures made people feel accused.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The diary shows Saturdays are triple Tuesdays. The mechanic says short runs damage the car more.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The car was handed over with low fuel and rubbish twice. The weekly trips keep collapsing.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The fuel receipts show two people bought over half the litres. The fixed costs are 280,000 yen.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,The receipts show two people bought most fuel. The diary shows Saturdays are much busier.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,George,,"@Misaki, if two people use it most, does that mean the others are subsidising them?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@George, the damage from short runs means the car costs more to maintain than distance suggests.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,The collapsing weekly trips are the real problem. I need reliability for my clinic slot.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"The 280,000 yen is a fixed cost. The fuel is variable. We need to separate these.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,It feels unfair if some people drive a lot and others don't. But the fixed costs are shared.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,George,,"We must avoid the ""checking figures"" trap. It creates resentment. We need a system that feels fair without constant auditing.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The time cost of arranging is high. A system that reduces coordination time is valuable.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"If the weekly trips collapse, I cannot rely on the car. I need a guarantee for those hours.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"If we split fixed costs equally, but fuel by usage, is that fair? Or should fuel be split equally too?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,I think splitting fuel by usage makes sense. But I worry about how we track it without arguing.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,George,,The other households said asking favours is the killer. We need a system that doesn't require asking.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,A booking system might reduce the arranging time. But it adds administrative burden.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,A booking system could protect my weekly trips. But who enforces it?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I am leaning towards a system that accounts for the lopsided fuel use.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,I agree. We need to see the options now. I hope one of them is simple.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
